WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:03.284
Rajasthan is bigger than
the entire United Kingdom.

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:07.459
Rajasthan covers about
342,000 square kilometres.

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.940
The UK covers about 244,000.

00:00:11.455 --> 00:00:15.025
Maharashtra is slightly larger than Italy,
with more than twice the people.

00:00:15.041 --> 00:00:17.231
Uttar Pradesh has more people than Brazil.

00:00:17.491 --> 00:00:19.321
Which state should be
a country on the map?

